      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    weights = [0.30, 0.70]\n    standard_deviations = [0.12, 0.25]\n    correlation = 0.20\n\n    # Calculate portfolio variance\n    portfolio_variance = (\n        (weights[0] * standard_deviations[0]) ** 2\n        + (weights[1] * standard_deviations[1]) ** 2\n        + 2 * weights[0] * weights[1]\n        * standard_deviations[0] * standard_deviations[1]\n        * correlation\n    )\n\n    # Calculate standard deviation and express it as a percentage\n    portfolio_standard_deviation = portfolio_variance ** 0.5\n    answer = round(portfolio_standard_deviation * 100, 2)\n\n    # Return answer\n    return answer\n```",
